WEBVTT

00:00:01.630 --> 00:00:03.130
We're back!

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:07.000
You just feel more at ease back home, don't you?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Ah, not that this is my house...

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.670
I understand how you feel.

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:16.540
We always feel relieved when we
make it back from an adventure too.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:19.920
All sorts of stuff happened on our trip, but...

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:22.290
It was fun!

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:30.960
Does it look like you'll be able
to fix your pendant?

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:35.880
Hmm... It'll probably take a bit of effort
to get it back to how it used to be.

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:38.880
The chain was torn to pieces, after all.

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:42.290
There aren't any issues with
the pendant itself, though.

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:44.750
Can you ask Mr. Gizdo to handle it?

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:47.170
Yes, the blacksmith could
surely take care of it!

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:49.420
The issue is the materials.

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:53.630
If they aren't properly processed,
all sorts of issues could arise.

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:56.080
So you can't make any substitutions, huh?

00:00:56.080 --> 00:01:00.170
But you can't get ahold of stuff
like that outside of the capital...

00:01:00.630 --> 00:01:03.040
I guess I'll just have to ask my master.

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:04.380
Master?

00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:06.540
I'll send a letter through the transfer circle.

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:09.330
In that case, let's send along a souvenir too!

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.040
Do you mean some slices of ligarex meat?

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:16.000
Even if we hand them out to the townsfolk,
we'll still have leftovers.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:19.420
Indeed! It was truly delicious broiled!

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:21.460
I'm sure she'll appreciate it!

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:25.170
Yeah, you're right!

00:01:32.630 --> 00:01:36.790
Starting today, I can see a small star

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:40.210
Shining bright in my heart

00:01:40.210 --> 00:01:43.500
Whether crying, laughing, or shining

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:45.750
I'll roll up my sleeves and get walking

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:48.960
(It'll definitely be alright, give your worries the go sign)

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:51.210
(Let's do this right)

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:58.580
Being free can feel so restricting

00:01:58.580 --> 00:02:01.920
After all, it never ends

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:05.330
This spiral of theoretical values and test results

00:02:05.790 --> 00:02:07.420
Whether I win or lose

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:09.000
(No matter what I try)

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:10.670
I work hard to see my dream come true

00:02:10.670 --> 00:02:12.500
(It's not a cheat, it's a life hack)

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:15.960
I've got the license to take my proper first step

00:02:15.960 --> 00:02:18.210
This is just the beginning

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:22.460
Starting today, I can see a small star

00:02:22.460 --> 00:02:25.880
Shining bright in my heart

00:02:25.880 --> 00:02:29.250
Whether crying, laughing, or shining

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:31.830
I take a deep breath before work

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:36.000
Resound, as I reach out towards a whole new world

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:39.330
My dream is surely in my hands

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:42.750
An original only I can make

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:45.460
Open that door and say welcome

00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:47.960
(This is the start)

00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:51.460
(It'll definitely be alright, give your worries the go sign)

00:02:51.460 --> 00:02:53.880
(Let's do this right)

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:01.580
Now then, what should I write...?

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:04.580
Can you not just write it out
like your normal orders?

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:08.540
Well you see, this was actually
a present from my master.

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:13.000
So I've got to explain properly
how the chain broke...

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:16.130
It's really important, isn't it?

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:17.210
Yeah...

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:19.880
Without this pendant,

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:24.290
I never would have been able to even take
my very first step as an alchemist.

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:35.330
This is a pretty serious question...

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:46.380
Welcome!

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:49.460
My, what an adorable customer!

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:50.920
U-um...

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:53.380
They're so beautiful...

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:56.130
Um, about the flyer out front!

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:59.130
Ah, are you a student
looking for part-time work?

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:00.420
Oh, yes.

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:02.540
My last short-term job just ended...

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:06.630
And I need to keep on working for
my daily necessities and everything.

00:04:06.630 --> 00:04:08.830
It's tough being a student, isn't it?

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:11.790
So, for the question written outside!

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:16.250
We learned three points to make note of
when extracting relentalus in school,

00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:18.380
but there are two more
written in the first volume of

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:22.420
Regendorf's "Pharmaceutical Basics:
Practice-based Theoretical Studies!"

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:25.130
One is that for the
heating process done in advance,

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:27.630
it should be kept at a temperature
where you can still touch it by hand!

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:29.080
If you boil it like normal,

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:33.420
crucial components will dissolve into
the water and you'll extract less in the end!

00:04:33.420 --> 00:04:35.420
The other is, er, um...

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:36.420
Yes...

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:39.500
you certainly seem to have studied well.

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:42.420
Now then, please take a look at this problem!

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:43.580
Huh?

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:44.580
Um...

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:49.290
I see, so that's how it is.

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:53.130
Oh yes, I see, the problem out front
was just the preliminary test,

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:54.630
while this is the real deal!

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:56.130
That's it, right?!

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:04.920
All done!

00:05:05.210 --> 00:05:06.250
My...

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:11.540
You got them all right.

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:18.170
I'm the shop manager Ophelia,
while this is my clerk, Maria.

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:20.540
Come on, follow me.

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:22.250
Huh? Um...

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:23.460
You're hired.

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:25.710
Y-you mean it?!

00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:27.630
What, are you somehow dissatisfied?

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:30.630
N-no, of course not!

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:33.540
I-I'm Sarasa Feed, ten years old!

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:35.420
I look forward to working under you!

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:46.880
Have a seat.

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:48.250
R-right...

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:52.630
So, what alchemy experience
have you had up until now?

00:05:52.630 --> 00:05:54.880
None. B-but...!

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:57.630
I've trained properly in school!

00:05:57.630 --> 00:06:01.380
And I'll keep on giving my all to my studies,
so I'm certain I'll be of use...!

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:03.130
That's enough of all that.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:07.540
It's actually more convenient on my end
if you're less experienced.

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:09.130
Convenient?

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:10.580
That's right...

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:13.790
But before chatting away about everything,
let's give you a try.

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:16.000
That should make things
easier to understand.

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:18.750
Do you know how to make
a magical crystal?

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:22.170
Just theoretically.
I've never actually done it before...

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:25.460
Of course. I'm sure you
wouldn't be here if you had.

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:28.170
Grab that alchemic cauldron.

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:34.170
Now try pouring your magical power into it.

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:35.710
R-right.

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:40.500
I haven't had anything
but lectures at school...

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:44.210
This will be my first hands-on training
as an alchemist.

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:49.000
Careful...

00:06:49.710 --> 00:06:51.040
Careful...

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:05.580
Huh? Am I dead?

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:13.880
Looks like ice was the right choice,
but this is even more than I expected.

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:15.920
Huh?!

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:22.670
If you hadn't covered me with that,
would I have been frozen over too?!

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:25.790
Well, when you don't handle
your magical power properly,

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:28.080
alchemy can be quite dangerous.

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:31.460
And you seem to have quite a massive
amount of magical power too.

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:34.670
So I wanted to have you experience this.

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:38.170
Ah wait, but are you alright?!

00:07:38.170 --> 00:07:39.880
And the room...!

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:43.040
Oh, that's no issue.

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:48.040
Is that better?

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:49.630
A-amazing...

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:52.250
Still, why did that end up happening...?

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:53.750
I told you, right?

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:56.250
You messed up handling
your magical power.

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:57.630
Messed up...

00:07:57.880 --> 00:07:59.540
Don't let it get you down, though.

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:01.670
It's your strong point too.

00:08:01.670 --> 00:08:03.000
My strong point?

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:06.460
You have a greater amount of
magical power than most.

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:08.790
I could tell at a glance.

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:14.130
Considering you're just ten years old,
that's quite astounding.

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:16.750
But that's also what
makes things so dangerous.

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:21.830
For example, a child could pour a wine bottle
into a glass without it spilling,

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:26.210
but even an especially strong adult
couldn't manage that with a cask.

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:29.040
It would be a huge mess,
with wine overflowing from the glass.

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:32.250
Of course with wine
it'd just cause some stains,

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:35.250
but when it comes to magical power,
lives can be at risk

00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:37.040
depending on how things play out!

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:42.500
My quantity of magical power
is that dangerous...?

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:46.750
I handled it this time around,
but if you do that at school...

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:48.330
If I do it at school?

00:08:48.330 --> 00:08:52.210
You'll have your magical power sealed away
and be expelled, without fail.

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:53.830
That can't happen!

00:08:53.830 --> 00:08:55.750
I mean, I finally made it into school...!

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:58.670
I don't have any parents.

00:08:58.670 --> 00:09:00.790
I was raised in an orphanage.

00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:04.500
So I've got to graduate properly,
and get my own shop...

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:08.330
And then, I've got to pay back
the people who took care of me!

00:09:08.630 --> 00:09:12.000
I need to become an alchemist,
no matter what!

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:16.170
Got it...

00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:17.500
Hold on for a bit.

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:19.630
Huh?

00:09:25.880 --> 00:09:26.880
Um...

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:28.830
It will likely be just a bit longer.

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:34.540
Still... Ophelia just couldn't leave you be.

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:44.170
Take it.

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:45.420
What is it...?

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:48.670
It's an artifact to restrict
your magical power output.

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:52.130
It should make your power
easier to manipulate.

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:54.330
Huh?! You made this for me?

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:56.170
Yeah, go ahead and take it.

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:59.040
B-but it looks so expensive!

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:00.080
However!

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:03.960
You're to work here at this shop
until you graduate.

00:10:04.210 --> 00:10:05.540
That's my condition.

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:06.290
Huh?

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:07.580
Don't worry.

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:10.380
It's not like I'm going to force you
to work for free in exchange.

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:12.000
You'll get a salary.

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:15.380
Thank you so much!

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:20.750
Ah, I was hired for a part-time job,
and I was given this pendant too.

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:23.830
And she even said I could
work here until I graduate...!

00:10:24.420 --> 00:10:27.920
It all works out in my favor!

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:31.750
Your training could prove intense,
but well, give it your all.

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:33.290
Huh?! Training?

00:10:33.290 --> 00:10:37.080
That's what it means to work
in an alchemist's shop.

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:41.380
You'll receive a salary and
get to focus on your studies,

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:43.040
and you'll learn things here too.

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:47.290
That's why our advertisement
was limited to new students.

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:54.250
I'll work hard with all my heart!

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:57.290
And I look forward to
working for you, Owner!

00:10:57.290 --> 00:10:58.710
No, Master!

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:00.960
Er, Teach?

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:01.500
Professor?

00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:01.960
Here's to working together, Sarasa.
Professor?<b></b>

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:03.750
Here's to working together, Sarasa.
No, it's gotta be Master!<b></b>

00:11:04.210 --> 00:11:05.210
Right!

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:13.790
That pendant represents your bond
with your master, doesn't it?

00:11:14.830 --> 00:11:15.960
Yeah...

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:32.540
Is that a bit too much?

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:34.960
There's nothing wrong with
going on the high side!

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:38.420
I feel like I wouldn't get sick of broiled
ligarex even if I ate it every single day!

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:40.960
I'm sure we'll be able to use up even this...

00:11:42.790 --> 00:11:44.210
M-my apologies!

00:11:44.210 --> 00:11:46.250
It's so slippery that it
slipped from my hands!

00:11:47.960 --> 00:11:50.540
Even though we did
the basic preparations on it...

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:53.960
Ligarexes sure are impressively slippery...

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:58.790
Well then, I'm activating it!

00:11:58.790 --> 00:12:00.830
Please step back, everyone!

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:04.880
There's no telling what might happen
if you get mixed up in it...

00:12:04.880 --> 00:12:06.880
Whatever do you mean?

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:10.830
There's a safety function,
so I think that it should be fine.

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:15.830
Even so, there are no cases of
live creatures being transferred,

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:19.960
so even I have no clue
what may occur in such a case.

00:12:20.080 --> 00:12:21.630
U-understood...

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:24.420
I suppose there's no harm in keeping back.

00:12:24.580 --> 00:12:26.830
Well then, here goes...

00:12:35.580 --> 00:12:36.460
Watch out!

00:12:44.710 --> 00:12:45.540
Iris!

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:46.460
Ms. Sarasa!

00:12:46.880 --> 00:12:50.040
Oh no! The pendant got sent too...!

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:52.670
I'll have to have Master send it back...

00:12:52.670 --> 00:12:55.500
I am truly, deeply sorry, Ms. Owner...

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:58.710
Don't worry. I'll let her know right away.

00:13:09.210 --> 00:13:11.670
Oh? Is it something from Sarasa?

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:17.420
Something seems off...

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:18.580
What's this about?

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:25.920
This is...

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:30.580
My deepest apologies, Ms. Owner!

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:33.290
My carelessness has gone too far!

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:35.540
No words of apology could ever be enough!

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:36.040
Please lift your head, Ms. Iris!

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:37.960
Please lift your head, Ms. Iris!
I am sorry!<b></b>

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:39.830
I'm the one at fault!
So terribly sorry! I apologize!<b></b>

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:41.790
After all, I wasn't cautious enough
when doing the transfer.
So terribly sorry! I apologize!<b></b>

00:13:41.790 --> 00:13:44.040
After all, I wasn't cautious enough
when doing the transfer.
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!<b></b>

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:45.630
B-but...

00:13:46.080 --> 00:13:47.960
Is it broken?

00:13:48.210 --> 00:13:49.460
It seems so.

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:51.290
After that strange reaction,

00:13:51.290 --> 00:13:54.750
it doesn't respond at all no matter
how much I try to add magical power to it.

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:57.540
Is it because the pendant was sent along?

00:13:57.880 --> 00:14:00.540
Hmm, I don't think that's it.

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:04.460
It's common to transfer artifacts, after all.

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:06.960
There may have been some other cause...

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:11.000
In all likelihood,
the pendant made it to my master.

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:14.580
But even if she senses something is off
and sends it back,

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:17.040
that would normally take a month.

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:20.040
What will you do about running
the shop in the meantime?

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:22.080
I intend to keep going, of course.

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:26.710
That artifact just restricts
my output of magical power.

00:14:26.710 --> 00:14:29.920
It isn't as if I can't use alchemy at all.

00:14:29.920 --> 00:14:30.960
But...

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:33.380
As long as I'm plenty careful,
it should be fine!

00:14:33.380 --> 00:14:38.210
After all, I've grown a lot since
Master gave me that pendant!

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:40.880
Come on, stand back up.
I'm sorry, I'm sorry...<b></b>

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:46.040
I'll work on repairing the transfer circle
in my spare moments.

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:49.540
And it may even just fix itself
once some time has passed.

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:54.420
Come on, now!

00:14:54.420 --> 00:14:55.630
Let's open for business!

00:14:55.630 --> 00:14:57.710
We've got to keep on giving our all!

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:23.540
Another failure...

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:28.540
I never knew it was this difficult to
regulate my magical power all on my own...

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:31.330
I really am still inexperienced.

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:42.790
Yeah, go ahead and take it.

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:49.210
Master...

00:15:52.540 --> 00:15:56.750
It doesn't look like I'll be able to
repair it just by working from our end.

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:59.580
I'll have to sync things up
with Sarasa again.

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:01.630
What caused it?

00:16:01.630 --> 00:16:03.000
I don't know just yet.

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:06.250
But it doesn't seem to be a technical issue...

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:10.710
There may have been some sort of change
that occurred in the activation of the alchemy.

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:12.540
What a hassle...

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:15.500
So you'll be preparing for a trip?

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:19.630
You're going, aren't you?
To your adorable apprentice?

00:16:20.210 --> 00:16:22.790
Which one of us is it who
finds her adorable, exactly?

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:26.080
Besides, you're the one who said to
take on an apprentice in the first place.

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:26.920
I...

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:29.130
You had no intention of doing that?

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:33.380
That's right. I really didn't.

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:36.580
Until that day when I met Sarasa...

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:42.670
I was surprised by her downright abnormal
amount of magical power, but that was all.

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:44.920
If it weren't for what you had said,

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:47.420
I would have never hit upon the idea
of taking her on as an apprentice...

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:49.380
However...

00:16:49.630 --> 00:16:54.330
There was a lot that I realized once I
actually did take her as my apprentice.

00:16:54.830 --> 00:17:00.330
Sarasa helped to remind me of that
fresh excitement towards alchemy.

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:04.290
Allow me to revise what I said before.

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:08.330
If it weren't for your advice, I would have
never experienced this sense of fulfillment.

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:10.290
So thank you.

00:17:11.290 --> 00:17:13.210
Such an exaggeration...

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:16.830
That advice just came down to
a bit of intuition on my part...

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:20.000
Your intuition's on the same level
as a divine revelation.

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:22.130
You're really overrating me there.

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:26.330
Maybe it really was a divine revelation
with Sarasa back then,

00:17:26.330 --> 00:17:30.000
that brought her here to this shop.

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:33.790
If she hadn't come here
her magic could have run wild,

00:17:33.790 --> 00:17:35.670
and then she would be
expelled from school,

00:17:35.670 --> 00:17:40.000
and have her path to becoming
an alchemist cut off.

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:43.080
I'm sure it was fate.

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:48.080
Here. Give my regards to
our little cutie, alright?

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:50.790
You certainly are prepared...

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:53.500
Well then, I'm heading out.

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:06.670
Ms. Owner... She's spent the
whole day again in her workshop.

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:09.000
Yes, it's been three days now...

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:12.380
It seems her training
really isn't going well after all...

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:23.420
What will I do if things stay like this forever...?

00:18:23.420 --> 00:18:27.170
Do I not have any choice but to
go get the pendant from Master?

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:30.460
But is it really there...?

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:33.500
I have no way of checking right now.

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:38.500
If... If it got sent off somewhere
strange during the transfer...

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:49.420
I-I'm sorry, for leaving the shop
to you this whole time.

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:51.630
That hasn't been an issue at all...

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:53.460
Um, Ms. Owner...

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:56.960
I-I'm going to go get a little fresh night air...

00:19:04.630 --> 00:19:05.710
Hey there!

00:19:12.040 --> 00:19:12.880
M...

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:15.290
Master...!

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:26.580
Here, I got it all fixed up.

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:30.000
U-um, Master, well...

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:33.460
What, are you saying you don't need it
after I went and brought it all this way?

00:19:33.460 --> 00:19:35.460
No, I definitely want it!

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:37.540
Thank you.

00:19:37.540 --> 00:19:40.040
Now then, next up is the transfer circle.

00:19:42.170 --> 00:19:45.500
Geez, if you were feeling that uneasy,

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:48.290
you should have just not worried about it
and come begging me to fix it.

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:52.830
But I'm running my own shop now...

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:56.500
I didn't want to go
relying on you right away.

00:19:56.750 --> 00:20:00.210
I want to become a fine alchemist
in my own right, as soon as I can.

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:06.170
I see, so your parents
lost their lives to bandits...

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:09.960
My mother and father had
a really wonderful shop.

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:12.170
The people working there
and the customers,

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:13.880
they all had smiles on their faces.

00:20:13.880 --> 00:20:17.040
I want to have a shop like that too!

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:21.540
I'll hurry up and become a fine alchemist,
and become like them...

00:20:22.420 --> 00:20:25.710
You want to hurry up and
become a fine alchemist, huh?

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:28.960
Well, it's not like I don't
understand how you feel.

00:20:29.420 --> 00:20:33.710
I was about your age
when I first got my own shop.

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:35.580
Huh?! You too, Master?!

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:36.420
Yeah.

00:20:36.830 --> 00:20:39.130
But well, that was a long time ago.

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:41.290
Now then, let's handle
the final adjustments!

00:20:41.790 --> 00:20:42.790
Right.

00:21:07.670 --> 00:21:09.960
You're leaving already?

00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:12.330
At least stay the night.

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:15.080
I don't have any more business here
with the transfer circle fixed.

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:19.000
And I can't leave my own shop
alone forever either.

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:22.580
Ms. Sarasa!

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:23.790
How is the transfer circle?!

00:21:23.790 --> 00:21:24.380
Ms. Owner!

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:25.920
Are you alright, Ms. Owner?
We were worried!<b></b>

00:21:25.920 --> 00:21:27.420
So worried!
Did you get a little sleep?<b></b>

00:21:27.420 --> 00:21:29.960
A-ah, don't worry.
Everything really is fine.

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:33.630
Sarasa... This is a good shop you've got here.

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:39.380
I'm off.

00:21:40.040 --> 00:21:41.170
Please take care!

00:21:41.170 --> 00:21:44.130
Make sure to eat the broiled ligarex!
Even if it is slippery!

00:21:44.130 --> 00:21:45.420
Come again sometime!

00:21:45.710 --> 00:21:50.830
Master, I'll make this into
an even better shop.

00:21:51.250 --> 00:21:53.960
Though I'm sure I'll still rely on you
a whole lot more.

00:21:54.670 --> 00:21:57.580
Even so, I'll definitely see it through!

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:01.540
Give it all you've got.

00:22:24.500 --> 00:22:30.210
The sunlight gently streams in through my window

00:22:30.500 --> 00:22:36.000
Whispering that it's time to get up

00:22:36.420 --> 00:22:42.040
Bringing my anticipation and a bit of courage with me

00:22:42.420 --> 00:22:47.580
I set off to look for a tiny bit of growth

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:53.920
Peering lightly through the door opened for the first time

00:22:53.920 --> 00:23:01.460
My heart is pounding, alongside plenty of smiles

00:23:02.130 --> 00:23:09.040
Squeezing in plenty of new encounters

00:23:09.040 --> 00:23:14.250
Each time we mingle, a harmony is born

00:23:14.420 --> 00:23:21.290
I want to believe in every possibility

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:29.380
Just like I believe this sky will be clear again tomorrow

00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:40.380
