00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:40.380
<b>Other sales:</b>

00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:40.380
<b>Ingredients purchased from gatherers:</b>

00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:40.380
<b>Debt payment from Iris and Kate:</b>
